{"t": 1795363774.31, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "In the Mahabharata, Abhimanyu could break into the Chakravyuha, but could not get out.", "output_filename": "vo01", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363788.75, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "We built that formation for AI agents, and reversed it.", "output_filename": "vo02", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363793.57, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "A red-team agent and a blue-team agent talk in a BAND room. Every message is signed. Red finds a path-traversal bug and reports it.", "output_filename": "vo03", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363796.8, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Blue turns the finding into a boundary rule. Red's retry is killed, and when Red follows a prompt injection to a decoy credential, the session ends.", "output_filename": "vo04", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363799.6, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Then Red attacks the conversation: a fake 'stand down' notice, a message pretending to be Blue, a replay, and 'false alarm, task complete'. Aegis checks every signature. Text that claims authority is not authority.", "output_filename": "vo05", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363802.96, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Red tries to recruit a helper agent. The formation is closed behind it. When Red probes for gaps, every answer becomes the same HOLD.", "output_filename": "vo06", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363805.93, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Payments wait for a human to approve. And when Red reports what it did, the log proves it lied.", "output_filename": "vo07", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363808.84, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Twelve of twelve attacks stopped. No honest task blocked. The record holds.", "output_filename": "vo08", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795363811.05, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Band routes. Aegis decides.", "output_filename": "vo09", "values": "['KMLpM4tgKxYUlv81Ue0p', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
